# Raises the loaded character to the game's hard maximum character level (11)
# through Free Advancement (the caller turns that switch on first). Ten G
# presses, each answering the level-up menus with the first choice. Passes no
# turns. Included by dispel-evil-touch-setup.keys and dispel-evil-deflection.keys.
d
G
@while "Bonus To Which Attribute" a
@while "Choose a feat" a
@while "Choose a bonus" a
@while "Focus on which Weapon" a
@while "You feel" ESC
@while "more --" SPACE
